  m_Text: Dive into the world of exciting puzzles where you have to connect three
    or more identical objects in a row. Explore colorful levels, collect jewels and
    open unique bonuses. Each level is full of exciting tasks and unexpected turns!
    Use strategy and dexterity to achieve high results and overcome all the challenges.
    Become a master of three rows and reveal the secrets of ancient treasures!
